{"recordId":"emperor_陳蒨","name":"陳蒨","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"陳文帝","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"陈文帝","pageId":111853,"revisionId":93506955,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-16T17:31:50Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E6%96%87%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93506955","wikidataId":"Q712113","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"新唐书·宰相世系表","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"陳書","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:03.210Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:liangshu","source:nanshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:liangshu-8849895c6bf2ecff","query":"陳蒨","count":2,"offset":678,"excerpt":"都督中外諸軍事、車騎將軍、揚、南徐二州刺史司空如故。震州刺史杜龕舉兵，攻信武將軍陳蒨於長城，義興太守韋載據郡以應之。癸丑，進太尉蕭循爲太保，新除司徒建安公淵明爲太傅，司徒蕭勃爲太尉。以鎮南將軍王琳爲車騎將軍、開府儀同三司。戊午，尊所生夏貴妃爲皇","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liangshu-073fefb0b095f1f8","query":"陳蒨","count":1,"offset":2889,"excerpt":"每以法繩其宗門，無所縱捨，霸先銜之切齒。及僧辯敗，龕乃據吳興以距之，遣軍副杜泰攻陳蒨於長城，反爲蒨所敗。霸先乃遣將周文育討龕，龕令從弟北叟出距，又爲文育所破，走義興，霸先親率衆圍之。會齊將柳達摩等襲京師，霸先恐，遂還與齊人連和。龕聞齊兵還，乃降","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:nanshi-004b192a93573a39","query":"陳蒨","count":2,"offset":9052,"excerpt":"建安郡公。壬子，加司空陳霸先尚書令、都督中外諸軍事。震州刺史杜龕舉兵，攻信武將軍陳蒨于長城，義興太守韋載應之。癸丑，以太尉蕭循為太保，以司徒蕭明為太傅，司徒蕭勃為太尉，以鎮南將軍王琳為車騎將軍、開府儀同三司。戊午，尊所生夏貴妃為皇太后，立妃王氏","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:nanshi-c337b96937668e68","query":"陳蒨","count":1,"offset":7602,"excerpt":"齧一人中喉即死。彪拔刀逐之，映火識之，曰：「何忍舉惡。卿須我者但可取頭，誓不生見陳蒨。」劫曰：「官不肯去，請就平地。」彪知不免，謂妻楊呼爲鄕里曰：「我不忍令鄕里落佗處，今當先殺鄕里然後就死。」楊引頸受刀，曾不辭憚。彪不下刀，便相隨下嶺到平處。謂","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:liangshu-8849895c6bf2ecff","bookId":"book:liangshu","requestedTitle":"梁書/卷06","title":"梁書/卷06","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2311629","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706?action=history","revisionId":2311629,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-09-07T02:34:19Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:45:02.831Z","sha256":"19d67594794369b7a3792773604f35c1e92418e3a82bd2c6206000f954305772","textSha256":"091d50f2b49fb9302f5e5cc4b14a472983a302f393e0c903ae6c4dd0d9997935","expandedWikitextSha256":"19d67594794369b7a3792773604f35c1e92418e3a82bd2c6206000f954305772","characters":4683,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/liangshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.241Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/adaa7b5d27c21277bd59.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/adaa7b5d27c21277bd59.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:liangshu-073fefb0b095f1f8","bookId":"book:liangshu","requestedTitle":"梁書/卷46","title":"梁書/卷46","sourceUrl